{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301071","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301071","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1430107101:1":{"text":"窯の温度を一定に保つには、ふいごで絶え間なく風を送り続けるしかないんだ！","source_cn":"想要保证火炉的温度恒定，就只有匀速，连续的拉动风箱，为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EDE21C038D65D2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430107102:1":{"text":"それから、窯を開ける前にやるべきこと、覚えてるか？","source_cn":"我问你，除了保证火炉温度恒定之外，每次开炉前还要做什么准备？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90E5024B01B97494","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1430107103:1":{"text":"はぁ、はぁ……えっと、冶金の神に、純粋な鉱石を二つ、捧げます……！","source_cn":"呼，我记得，要，要向冶金之神献上两块最纯洁的，矿石。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BF2C140B49FE7BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠铁须":{"text":"職人のハガルド","source":"工匠铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:学徒铁哥达":{"text":"弟子のテゴダ","source":"学徒铁哥达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}